<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1TES - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Batesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA MARHANZI EMWA ABATESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="h">AMARHANZI EMWA ABATESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARHANZI EMWA ABATESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi oku maruba marhanzi emwa Abatesalonika</para>
  <para style="ip">Muli gano maruba marhanzi-rhanzi Paolo ayandikiraga Abanya-Tesalonika omu mwâka gwa 52, ababwire, erhi: « <char style="vp">1, 9</char> <char style="iqt">Ntâho barhadwîrhi baganîra oku mwarhuyankiriraga, n’oku mwalekaga abazimu binyu, mpu mushimbe Nnâmahanga munashige Nyamuzinda w’obuzîne n’ow’okunali,</char> <char style="vp">10</char> <char style="iqt">munalinge oku Omugala agaluka kurhenga ­empingu, olya Mugala afûlaga omu bafù, ye Yezu, orhuciza obukunizi bwayisha.</char>»</para>
  <para style="ip">Paolo ashib’ibwîra abatesalonika, erhi: «Bundi bulangâlire buci rhugwêrhe, gandi masîma maci rhwâbone, lindi ishungwè lihi lyârhulêrhere irenge embere za Nnawîrhu Yezu olusiku âgaluka, aha nyuma zinyu? Nêci, mw’oyo mwe irenge lîrhu, mwe na busîme bwîrhu» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 2:19">2, 19</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paolo ali akengeza abakristu kurhi bakwânîne okulama omu kulinda oku Yezu agaluka; ebi Nnâmahanga alonza kuhika amango Omugala galuka kuli kurhujira batagatîfu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:1">5, 1</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:19">2, 19</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 3:13">3, 13</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:15">4, 15</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">5, 2</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:23">5, 23</ref></char>). Co cirhumire enyigîrizo nkulu z’amaruba kuli kubwîra abakristu kurhi balinda olwo lusiku: kulama omu butagatîfu, bayâke eby’enshonyi, banalame omu buzigire (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:7-8">5, 7-8</ref></char>). Na ntâye omanyire olusiku n’amango Nnâhamwîrhu agaluka (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:1">5, 1</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>Paolo, Silvano na Timoteyo, kuli Ekleziya y’Abatesalonika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Batesalonika; Banya-Tesalonika; Bantu b’e Tesalonika</char></note> eri muli Nyamuzinda Îshe na muli Nyakasane Yezu Kristu. Kuli mwe enshôkano n’obuholo!<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Avuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa anabasîma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Rhurhahusa okuvuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa ngasi mango mwe mweshi murhumire n’okummukengêra omu nsengero zîrhu. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Ngasi kasanzi, embere za Larha Nnâmahanga, erhi kugerêreza rhugerêreza ebijiro by’obuyêmêre bwinyu, n’emikolo y’obuzigire bwinyu, n’obulangâlire bwinyu bukomîre, muli Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="1TH 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Rhurhahabiri, bene wîrhu bazigirwa ba Nnâmahanga, oku muli nshâgi zâge. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Bulya Emyanzi y’Akalembe rhwamudwîrhîre birhali binwa byône, ci yali eyegemîre obuhashe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buhashe bw’okujira ebisômerîne.</char></note>, na Mukà Mutagatîfu, n’oburhwâli burhalimwo bwôba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oburhwâli burhalimwo bwôba: bijiro by’okumanyîsa oku Mûka Mutagatîfu ye wakâg’ikolêsa Paolo.</char></note>. Ninyu mwêne mumanyire kurhi rhwàli rhuyôsire muli mwe nti lyo rhummukwânana. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Ninyu mwarhulolerakwo olwiganyo, mwacîsêza okushusha Nyakasane, mwayankirira Oluderho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oluderho, yo Myanzi y Akalembe.</char></note> n’enshagali ya Mûka Mutagatîfu, n’obwo mwâli omu malibuko manji, <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>na ntyo mwabà lwingayo oku bemêzi boshi b’e Macedoniya n’e Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Nêci, kurhenga emwinyu Oluderho lwa Nyakasane lwayumvîkîne, arhali omu Macedoniya n’omu Akaya mwône, ci na hoshi hoshi obuyêmêre bwinyu muli Nyamuzinda bwajîre irenge, na ntyo ntacicîrhamya nakuderha. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Ntâho barhadwîrhi baganîra oku mwarhuyankiriraga, n’oku mwalekaga abazimu binyu, mpu mushimbe Nnâmahanga munashige Nyamuzinda w’obuzîne n’ow’okunali, <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>munalinge oku Omugala agaluka kurhenga empingu, olya Mugala afûlaga omu bafù, ye Yezu, orhuciza obukunizi bwayisha.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku Paolo ayôrhaga erhi ali e Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Ninyu mwêne murhahabiri, bene wîrhu, oku rhurharhamiraga busha erhi rhuyisha emwinyu. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Erhi rhubà rhwamâlibuzibwa n’okujâcira e Filipi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2, 2 </char><char style="xta" closed="false">Lolà </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Ebj 16, 19-40</ref>.</char></note>, nk’oku mumanyire, Nyamuzinda wîrhu arhuhà oburhwâli bw’okummuyigîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe yâge omu ntambala ndârhi la. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Enyigîrizo zîrhu zirhali za bunywesi, nîsi erhi za bugalugalu erhi bulyâlya. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Ci kulya kubà Nyamuzinda abwîne oku rhukwânîne, arhufumbasize Emyanzi y’Akalembe yâge; nîrhu nka rhwahanûla, rhurhalonza okusîmîsa abantu, ci Nyamuzinda yêne oyishi ebi­rhuli emurhima. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Na ntà mango rhusâg’iderha ebinwa by’okulimîriza, ninyu mwêne murhakuhabiri, erhi okujira akantu kankafulika amagene g’eby’en’igulu; Nyamuzinda ye muhamîrizi wâni muli okwo. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>N’oli emwinyu, oli ahandi, ntasâg’ibona rhwalonza okukuzibwa n’abantu, <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>n’obwo rhwankahashire okummuyêreka obuhashe bwîrhu, kulya kubà rhuli ntumwa za Kristu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:7">Ci rhwacijira banyinyi ekarhî kinyu, rhwayôrha nka muzîre walîsa abâna bâge n’okubashîbirira. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Omu buzigire bwîrhu kuli mwe, rhwankalonzize rhummuhè, arhali Emyanzi y’Akalembe ka Nyamuzinda yône, ci n’obuzîne bwîrhu ciru, bulya mwâli murhonyire bwenêne emunda rhuli! <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Mucikengîre, bene wîrhu, emirimo n’emiluho yîrhu: rhwakâg’immuyigîriza Emyanzi y'Akalembe ya Nnâmahanga omu kukola budufu na mûshi nti lyo rhurhazidohera ndi muli mwe. <verse eid="1TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Mw’oyo na Nyamuzinda mwanahamîriza kurhi rhwàli batagatîfu, bashinganyanya na bêru-kwêru kuli mwe bemêzi. <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Muyishi bwinjà oku rhwajirîre ngasi muguma muli mwe nka kula omubusi ajirira abâna bâge: <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>rhwakazir’immuhanûla, rhwakammuhà omurhima, rhwanakammulahiriza nti olugendo lwinyu luyôrhe lukwânana Nnâmahanga wammuhamagalaga omu Bwâmi bwâge n’omu irenge lyâge.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuyêmêre n’obushîbirizi bw’Abatesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Co c’irhumire oku bwîrhu rhwêhe, rhurhahusa okuvuga Nyamuzinda omunkwa, bulya erhi mubà mwamayumva Oluderho lwâge rhwammumanyîsagya, murhaluyankiriraga nka kanwa ka muntu, ci, nk’oku lunali, mwaluyankirira nka Luderho lwa Nnâmahanga. Olwo Luderho kukola muli mwe, mwe bemêzi. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Nêci, bene wîrhu, mwayankîre olwiganyo oku Ekleziya za Nyamuzinda ziri omu Yudeya muli Kristu Yezu; kulya kubà ninyu mwalibuzîbwe n’abà­ntu b’omu cihugo cinyu nk’oku ezo Ekleziya zalibuzibagwa n’Abayahudi, <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>balyâla bayîrhaga Nyakasane Yezu n’abalêbi; bâbo bo bàrhulibuzagya; barhasîmîsa Nnâmahanga, banali bashombanyi b’abantu boshi. <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Banakarhuhanza okuyigîriza abapagani mpu lyo barhacunguka; na ntyo barhahusa okuyûshûla olugero lw’ebyâha byâbo. Ci lêro obukunizi bwa Nyamuzinda mîra bwabarhindagakwo.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Rhwêhe, bene wîrhu, kurhenga rhujira nsiku rhurhabonana n’amasù, ci arhali omu murhima, rhwayumva rhukola rhucîfinjire okushub’ibona obusù bwinyu, rhwanayumva rhummuduzire bwenêne. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Rhwanacilalira okujà e­mwinyu; nie ono Paolo nakuhizire kanji, ci shetani akarhutwîra omu majira. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Bundi bulangâlire buci rhugwêrhe, gandi masîma maci rhwâbone, lindi ishungwè lihi lyârhulêrhere irenge embere za Nnawîrhu Yezu olusiku âgaluka, aha nyuma zinyu? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Nêci, mw’oyo mwe irenge lîrhu, mwe na busîme bwîrhu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Paolo arhuma Timoteyo e Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Erhi rhubona rhurhacihashiri, rhwahiga okuyôrha rhwêne Atena; <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>rhwarhuma Timoteyo, mwene wîrhu na murhumisi wa Nyamuzinda omu kulumîza Emyanzi y'Akalembe ya Kristu, nti ammuzibuhye anammukomeze omu buyêmêre bwinyu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>lyo harhag’ijira owarhà omurhima muli ago malibuko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amalumwa n’amalibuko co cimanyîso c’omukristu osêzire omu buyêmêre en’igulu.</char></note>. Ninyu mwêne murhahabiri oku eco co cigabi cîrhu. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Bulya rhuli emwinyu, rhwakâg’immurhonda oku kukwânîne rhubone amalibuko; kwo byanayishirig’ibà, murhakuhabiri. <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Erhi mbona ntacihashiri nanacimurhuma nti adôse emyanzi y’obuyêmêre bwinyu nti kwankanabà Omushumisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omushumisi ye Shetani.</char></note> mîra ammushumikaga, n’omukolo gwîrhu gubè gwafîre busha.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Avuga omunkwa oku myanzi Timoteyo amudwîrhîre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Ci buno Timoteyo arhuhandîre, arhenga emwinyu, arhudwîrhîre emyanzi minjà y’obuyêmêre bwinyu n’obuzigire bwinyu; arhubwîzire oku kudula muci­rhudula, n’oku mucîfinja bwenêne okushub’irhulolakwo nk’oku nîrhu rhucîfinja okushub’immubonakwo. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Ntyo, bene wîrhu, omu malumwa n’omu malibuko gîrhu ga ngasi lubero, obuyêmêre bwinyu bwarhuhîre omurhima. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Nêci, rhuyumvîrhe rhukola rhugwêrhe emisî bulya mukomîre muli Nyakasane. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Rhubwîragi nîrhu kurhi rhwankahash’ivuga Nyamuzinda omunkwa kuli mwe kw’aga masîma goshi rhudwîrhe rhwayumva embere za Nnâmahanga erhi mwe murhuma? <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Budufu na mûshi erhi kushenga rhumushenga burhahusa, nti rhushub’ibona obusù bwinyu, rhunayûshûle ebibulikîne omu buyêmêre bwinyu. <verse eid="1TH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Mâshi Nyamuzinda yêne, Larha na Nnawîrhu Yezu, barhufukûlire enjira y’okuhika emwinyu! <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Ninyu Nyakasane ammuyôlolose anammujire bimâna omu kuzigirana mwêne na nnene n’omu kuzigira abantu boshi nk’oku rhummuzigira! <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Na ntyo akomeze emirhima yinyu; ayijire myêru-kwêru omu butagatîfu embere za Larha Nyamuzinda, amango nnawîrhu Yezu ayisha bo n’abatagatîfu bâge boshi.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Amahano: obutagatîfu n’obuzigire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Nêci bene wîrhu, rhummuhûnyire rhunammuyinginzire muli Nyakasane Yezu nti mushimbe erya njira rhwammuyigîrizaya, erya njira emmuyêreka kurhi mukwânîne okuyôrha lyo musimîsa Nnâmahanga. Câbà kwo munakola muyôsire ntyo. Muhirage njira, mujè embere. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Mumanyire bwinjà marhegeko maci rhwammuhîre oku izîno lya Nyakasane Yezu. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Obulonza bwa Nnâmahanga b’obu: muhinduke batagatîfu; muleke eby’enshonyi; <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>ngasi muguma muli mwe amany’ilanga omubiri gwâge omu butagatîfu n’omu bukenge, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>arhacicîrîkiriraga omu kuhêkwa n’amîru mabî ak’abapagani barhishi Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Muli okwo harhajiraga owasârhaza mwene wâbo erhi okumujira buligo; bulya Nyakasane anacîhôle kw’ebyo byoshi, nka kulya rhwammubwiragakwo rhwanakuhamîriza <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Birhali bya nshonyi Nyamuzinda arhuhamagaliraga, ci butagatîfu. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Na ntyo owagayaguza ago marhegeko, erhi arhali muntu agayaguzize, ci Nyamuzinda yêne, owammushobôzagya Omûka gwâge Mutagatîfu.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Oku biyêrekîre okuzigirana, ntà bulagîrire mugwêrhe bw’okuyandikirwa, kulya kubà Nyamuzinda yêne wammuyigîrizagya okuzigirana mwêne na nnene, <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>erhi kwo munayôrha mujirira bene wîrhu boshi b’omu Macedoniya yoshi. Rhummuhûnyire nti muyûshûle okujà embere, bene wîrhu. <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>Mucîsêze okukarhûza, na ngasi muguma ashîbirire omulimo gwâge, munakole n’amaboko ginyu, nka kulya rhwammurhegekaga. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Ntyo olugendo lwinyu luyôrhe lushingânîne omu masù g’abâli embuga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abâli embuga, bo balya bahali b’omu mulala gwîrhu gw’abemêzi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:12">1 Kor 15, 12</ref></char>).</char></note>, na ntâye mwalagîrirakwo.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abazîne n’abafîre olusiku Nyakasane agaluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Bene wîrhu, rhurhalonza muhabe olw’abafîre, lyo murhag’ifà mutula ak’abandi barhajira bulangâlire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abandi barhajira bulangâlire; bo bapagani abo.</char></note>. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Akabà rhuyêmîre oku Yezu afîre anafûka, ntyo kwo abafîre muli Yezu nabo banayish’ibà: Nyamuzinda anabahêke bo naye. <verse eid="1TH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Okûla rhummubwîzirekwo n’obuhashe b’Oluderho lwa Nyakasane: rhwe rhucizîne, rhwe rhwâbè rhuciriho amango Nyakasane agaluka, rhurhakashokolera abafîre. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Bulya, oku cimanyîso, oku izù lya Malahika mukulu n’oku mushekera gwa Nyamuzinda, Nyakasane yêne anayandagale, kurhenga empingu, n’abafîre muli Kristu bo bâfûke barhanzi. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Okubundi nîrhu, rhwe nabo omu bitù, rhuj’ishimânana na Nyakasane omu malunga; na ntyo rhwâbêre na Nyakasane ensiku zoshi. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Mukaz’irhûlirizanya n’ebyo binwa.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Okubà masù omu kulinga okuyisha kwa Nyakasane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Oku nsiku n’amango, bene wîrhu, ntà bulagîrire mugwêrhe bw’okubiyandikirwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Ninyu mwêne mukumanyire bwinjà: Olusiku lwa Nyakasane kwo luyisha nka cishambo c’omu budufu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24, 36</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 24:43">43</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Amango abantu baderhe mpu: «Murhûla na kalembe», lyo obuhanya bwâbahonere oku caligumiza, kula emikero mibishi enarhogera omukazi oli izîmi, barhakanabona oku bayâka. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Mwêhe, bene wîrhu, murhali omu mwizimya, mpu olwo lusiku lummurhibukirekwo nka cishambo. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Mweshi muli bâna b'obumoleke n’ab’omûshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abakristu balemeragwa obumoleke n’omûshi: okuyôrha rhuli omu bumoleke n’omu bulangashane bw’omûshi bwo bwôrhere bwîrhu.</char></note>. Rhurhali bâna ba budufu nîsi erhi ba mwizimya. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Kuziga rhurhajaga îrò ak’abandi, ci rhubè masù erhikwo, rhurhanabaga badâdà. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Abajà îrò, budufu balijà, n’abalaluka, budufu balaluka. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Ci rhwêhe, rhwe b’omûshi, rhurhabaga badâdà; rhuyôrhe rhufumbasire empenzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rhuyôrhe rhufumbasire empenzi: Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:14-17">Efz 6, 14-17</ref></char>.</char></note> y’obuyêmêre n’obuzigire, rhuyambale n’ensirha y’obulangâlire bw’obucire. <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda arharhulemeraga bukunizi, ci mpu rhubone obucire Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu orhumire. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Arhufîrire mpu rhukabà rhuzîne erhi rhukabà rhurhazîni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rhukabà rhuli bagumagumà erhi rhukafà.</char></note>, rhulame rhulungîne naye. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Ntyo mukaz’irhûlirizanya mwêne na nnene, munakahânana olwiganyo lwinjà, nk’okûla munajira.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oku ababà haguma bakwânîne okuyôrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Rhummuhûnyire, bene wîrhu, nti mukâkenga balya bammuluhira, abammukulîre muli Nyakasane, banakammuhanûla. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Mubazigire kwâgo-kwâgo omukolo gwâbo gurhumire. Mubè n’omurhûla ekarhî kinyu. <verse eid="1TH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Mâshi, bene wîrhu rhummuhûnyire nti muhanûle abalerha akavulindi, muhè abwôba omurhima, muzibuhye engonyi, munakalembera abantu boshi. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Mumanye hankajira owagalulira omuntu obubî oku bubî; ci ngasi mango mucihangâne okujirirana aminjà mwêne na nnene, mugajirire n’abantu boshi. <verse eid="1TH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Mukâyôrha mushagalusire ensiku zoshi. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Mukâshenga oburhahusa. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Oku ngasi kantu mukaz’ivuga omunkwa, bulya ntyo kwo Nnâmahanga alonza kuli mwe, muli Kristu Yezu. <verse eid="1TH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>Murhazimagya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okuzimya Mûka kwo kujira akantu kankahanza omukolo gwa Mûka Mutagatîfu omu mirhima yîrhu.</char></note> Mûka Mutagatîfu; <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>murhagayaguzagya e­nshôkano y’obulêbi; <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>ci mulole bwinjà ngasi kantu, n’ebiri binjà byo muyôrhanage. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Mucîlange oku ngasi coshi ciderhwa cibî.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwangà n’omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Nyamuzinda w’omurhûla yêne ammujire batagatîfu lwoshi Lwoshi, alange emyûka n’emirhima n’emibiri yinyu buzira izâbyo kuhika olusiku Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu ayisha. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Ommuhamagire arhatwa omu kanwa kâge, yêne ye wajira okwo. <verse eid="1TH 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Murhusengerere nîrhu, bene wîrhu. <verse eid="1TH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Mulamuse bene wîrhu boshi n’ehinûnugurho hitagatîfu. <verse eid="1TH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Mmuhûnyire bwenêne muli Nyakasane nti aga maruba gasomerwe bene wîrhu boshi. <verse eid="1TH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Enshôkano ya Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu ebè ninyu!<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
